# VPN configs. Each section points at a native AmneziaWG config file; the
# keys, peers and obfuscation parameters live in that file, not here — which
# is why a new protocol version needs no change on the box.
#
# UCI keeps only what the file cannot express: whether the config is
# enabled. Every enabled config gets its own tunnel; the router's watchdog
# picks between them by RTT.
#
#   config config 'a1b2c3d4_awg_0'
#       option name      'AWG'
#       option enabled   '1'
#       option config    '/etc/seedex/vpn/a1b2c3d4-awg-0.conf'
#
# Sections are created by `sdx import <file.conf>` or LuCI. None are
# shipped by default.
